        "kind": "prose",
        "title": "Responsible results language",
        "body": "Use associational language for LST–NDVI links; reserve causal cooling claims for designs that support them. Separate surface heat from human exposure. State limitations: clear-sky bias, overpass time, native thermal resolution (~100 m for Landsat TIRS-class products), and absence of health outcome data when not collected."
